('Palm Beach','palm-beach',[],'palm-beach-parent','Parent describes June 1, 2026 ZIP with 812 precincts; actual linked GIS has 813 features.','ZIP returned403. Distinct 813-feature GIS is preserved; precinct8508 invalid in diagnostic. No reduction to812 or physical/results join.','palm-beach-parent'),
